   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES35:99d4a",
   "off": 630090,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「いくらグレイストーンが\r  力持ちだからって\u0010\b  いつまでもリオを抱えて\r  いられないわ\r  早く西地区の宿屋に…」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Strong as Greystone is,\u0010\bhe can't carry Rio around forever. Come on, we have to get him to the inn in the West District...\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
